      "id": "claim_4ef304c01fc6431fa777dadb721f6a5b",
      "statement": "The agent's tool set is defined with defineTool: readFile/writeFile/editFile, webFetch (https-only, no credentials, ~1 MiB cap, untrusted content), observeUserChanges (synthetic — inserted by the system when the user edits; direct calls return a no-op), describeBinding (required before using a binding's API — bindings do not implement APIs the model knows from training), setGadgetBinding, createGadget (optionally from a blueprintId), listBlueprints, executeCode, listConnectableResources, and requestConnection (must resolve to a specific resource; ends the turn until the user accepts or denies).",
