    {
      "id": "claim_b83dcde9dac3439e8e268954f8551b0f",
      "statement": "Two size bounds protect the change pipeline: CHAT_CHANGE_MESSAGE_BUDGET (1 MiB) bounds one changes message's composed change for the user edit path because materialization writes exactly one message per call (an unstorable message would wedge materialization forever, since rows only retire on success), and STEP_CHANGE_BUDGET (1.5 MiB) bounds one agent step's buffered changes so the barrier's single message fits the 2 MiB storage record cap.",
